# ---- CMake generates the solution and project files; never commit them ---
# The .sln / .vcxproj under build/ are outputs of `cmake -G "Visual Studio 17
# 2022"`.  Hand-editing or committing them is what broke this project once
# already: CMakeLists.txt is the single source of truth.
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user

